      "id": "shellplug",
      "kill": "all",
      "modified": 1786648277,
      "notes": "The Shell Plugin allows you to execute arbitrary shell scripts (or any language that supports a Shebang).  Simply select the Shell Plugin when creating an event or workflow, and enter your script.  This is an easy way to get up and running quickly, because you don't have to worry about reading or writing JSON.",
